  "details": "I'd like to propose that an option to quickly toggle the nameplates get added to the Tools menu in the Action/Radial menu.\n\nIt would make it much quicker to turn them on or off, which can help a lot with performance, especially in really busy instances.\n\nEven the new nameplates consist of more than just one draw call per user, and if the opacity is not set at 100%, the number of draw calls is doubled.\n\nAs it is, the tools menu only contains the personal mirror, face mirror, and chatbox - so there's plenty of room for it.",
